WEBVTT

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:02.518
I've seen the various
pressures of drought,

00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:05.018
heat, flooding, superstorms,

00:02:05.042 --> 00:02:07.601
invasive insects, bacterial blight,

00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:10.101
shifting seasons and weather volatility

00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:12.184
from Washington to Florida,

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:15.393
and from Guatemala to Australia.

00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:17.184
The upshot is this.

00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.893
Climate change is becoming
something we can taste.

00:02:19.917 --> 00:02:23.101
This is a kitchen-table issue
in the literal sense.

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.101
The International Panel on Climate Change

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:27.476
has predicted that by mid-century

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.476
the world may reach a threshold
of global warming